  "scenario_text": "# Experiment C - service failure (RQ2).\n# The primary inventory replica fails for a bounded window (t = 10..20 s of a 40 s measurement):\n# 100% injected errors vs an unresponsive (hang) instance. Policies fixed: timeout 800 ms, no retries,\n# breaker off, fallback OFF (so the failure is visible; Experiment G turns fallback on).\n# Faults are application-level (health endpoints keep answering). Stopping the container is a\n# separate, manual variant: scripts/fault_container.ps1 (the runner has no Docker access by design).\nid: C_service_failure\ntitle: \"C - Primary inventory failure: errors vs hang (fallback off)\"\nhypotheses: []\nrequires_mode: local\nworkload: {rate_rps: 20, arrival: poisson, warmup_s: 5, duration_s: 40}\nruns: 3\nseed: 303\ndefaults:\n  resilience: {timeout_ms: 800, retries: 0, circuit_breaker: {enabled: false}, fallback: false}\nconditions:\n  - name: error\n    faults: [{target: inventory-a, mode: error, at_s: 10, duration_s: 10}]\n  - name: hang\n    faults: [{target: inventory-a, mode: hang, at_s: 10, duration_s: 10}]\n",
